F calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids May to June and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025 the middle got 47% of normal in October to November and 48% in March to April. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 55% of normal on the middle. Grid 21501 had its driest year in 1963 at 70% of normal.</p>"}
